This file exists so `//go:embed all:web/dist` in web.go has something to match
on a fresh clone, before the frontend has been built.

Without it, `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` and `go test ./...` all fail on a
newly cloned repository with:

    pattern all:web/dist: no matching files found

`make build` builds the frontend into this directory first; a real build's
output is gitignored.
